usage: rive schema <Type> [flags]
       rive schema --search <text>

  <Type>          properties of a core type, inherited included
  --search <text> find types and properties by substring, then
                  pick one to describe
  --animatable    only properties that can be keyed
  --bindable      only properties that can be data bound
  --all           include editor-only properties
  --json          JSON: the type as one object, or the --list /
                  --search results as an array
  --list          pick a type to describe; without a picker,
                  every type name
